
[TestChanges_FormattingByLanguage_TypescriptCamelCase - 1]
# Test: typescript_camel_case

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /user-profiles/{userId}:
    get:
      operationId: getUserProfile
      parameters:
        - name: userId
          in: path
          required: true
          schema:
            type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
  /admin/system-config:
    post:
      operationId: updateSystemConfig
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /user-profiles/{userId}:
    get:
      operationId: getUserProfile
      parameters:
        - name: userId
          in: path
          required: true
          schema:
            type: string
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
  /admin/system-config:
    post:
      operationId: updateSystemConfig
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                maxRetries:
                  type: integer
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
  /analytics/user-events:
    post:
      operationId: trackUserEvents
      responses:
        '201':
          description: Created
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.trackUserEvents()`: **Added**
* `sdk.updateSystemConfig()`: 
  *  `request.maxRetries` **Added**

## Full Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.trackUserEvents()`: **Added**
* `sdk.updateSystemConfig()`: 
  *  `request.maxRetries` **Added**

